  "prefLabel": "Ncr 532.05 Permission Required to Extend the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 532.05 Permission Required to Extend the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions. Permission to extend the 180-day period for changes in land use shall be required from the director. At least 30 days prior to expiration of the 180-day period, a landowner or authorized agent shall apply for permission to extend the 180-day period by completing and submitting Form 532b, as described in Ncr 532.06.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5302.05), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
